2026-10-27T22:13:21.305Z	{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgTWaiZJxxFyP7kNJyUJc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Cursor scan found nothing to import automatically. Zero rules, settings, or skills on disk mapped to Claude Code equivalents.\n\nFour categories were noted that cannot be imported from files because Cursor keeps them in app state rather than on disk:\n\n- **User Rules** live in Cursor Settings. You would paste any you want into your user-level CLAUDE.md by hand.\n- **Team Rules** are managed in the Cursor dashboard. The Claude Code equivalent is an organization-wide CLAUDE.md or managed settings.\n- **Memories** have no file export. You would copy them from Cursor's Rules & Memories screen into CLAUDE.md.\n- **Custom Modes** are UI state with no Claude Code counterpart. If one were imported as a skill, you would invoke it with a slash command.\n\nHow would you like to proceed?\n\n1. Run the command below to write a reference skill that records those four unmapped items as a checklist for manual porting:\n\n```\n/import --yes=0cdf7310ccd49792d454cf55bb9123e4\n```\n\n2. Run `claude import` from a terminal to get the interactive checkbox picker, which lets you skip that reference skill and choose items individually.\n\n3. Do nothing, since there is no on-disk config to bring over."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6058,"cache_read_input_tokens":11384,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6058},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3552f361-5f39-4db3-b105-6e5ad20546ef","uuid":"825a4212-e55d-4e4a-8177-327353e85bc0","timestamp":"2026-10-27T22:13:21.304Z","request_id":"req_011CgTWaiLQv